## User Experience Focus [to-do]
- Ensure smooth, responsive animations
- Prioritize visual clarity in all feedback
- Create intuitive visual language for battle events
- Balance information density with visual appeal
- Optimize for mobile device viewing and interaction

## MVP Implementation Focus
- Prioritize faction-colored health bars that deplete with damage
- Implement clear zero-sum node control visualization
- Add network line glow effect for captured nodes
- Create smooth battle phase transitions
- Ensure timer visualization works correctly for 20-second duration

The MVP implementation should focus on creating clear, functional visual feedback that maintains performance standards. Advanced effects and optimizations can be introduced in future iterations after the core system is proven. 